*.pkgindex

# CLion
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#cmake-build-*
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
scratchpad/

# mlir-gen writes this dump into the CWD whenever the MLIR verifier fails
# (src/compiler/mlir_gen.cpp). It is a DEBUG ARTIFACT of one failed compile —
# ~14 MB, rewritten by any probe that trips the verifier. It was tracked, so a
# single failing experiment produced a 50 000-line diff that rode into an
# unrelated commit without being noticed. Generated output does not belong in
# the tree.
logos-mlir-verify-fail.mlir

# Agent worktrees created by the Workflow tool. Ephemeral, and LARGE — 6.4 GB of
# build trees after one four-item run. Never part of a commit; `git add -A` has
# swept a big untracked artifact into a commit here before.
.claude/worktrees/

# Agent worktree scratch (TMPDIR routed inside the worktree by the workflow brief).
.tmp/
